      "bytes": 1279304,
      "level": "Recommended",
      "intent": "Keep raw YAML editing and the generated TOC in place. Label the disclosure 'Front matter · YAML' and the contents block 'Contents · Generated'; add concise help 'Refreshes on save' and a labeled Refresh action. Use a small clear distinction between editable source and generated content. Pins: 1 raw metadata ownership is explicit; 2 generated entries are identified; 3 refresh behavior is explained. Do not turn YAML into a form or rewrite authored comments.",
      "annotations": [
        "Raw metadata ownership is explicit",
        "Generated entries are identified",
        "Refresh behavior is explained"
      ]
    }
  ],
